    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Paul Reynolds are offering for sale this 3-Bedroom End-Terrace Townhouse in a Prime Letterkenny Location\nSituated on Convent Road, just off Lower Main Street in Letterkenny, this well-positioned three-bedroom end-terrace townhouse offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, owner-occupiers and investors alike.\nThe property enjoys a highly convenient location within easy walking distance of Letterkenny town centre and a wide range of local amenities, including shops, schools, services and public transport links.\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming living room, a spacious kitchen/dining area with direct access to the rear patio/garden area, three well-proportioned first-floor bedrooms and a family bathroom.\nRecently redecorated throughout, the property is presented in good condition and offers comfortable accommodation with further potential to add value and personalise to suit individual requirements.\nIts central location, practical layout and strong rental potential make this an attractive opportunity in a sought-after residential area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nCarpet covered staircase leading to first floor.\n\nLiving Room - 5.4 x 4.5\nCarpet covering on floor. Cast Iron fireplace with timber surround and marble hearth. Access to under stair storage area. Coving and centre ceiling rose. Double door leading to kitchen/dining area.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 5.0 x 3.7\nTiled effect linoleum covering on floor. Eye and low level units with single drainer sink. Electric cooker with overhead extractor fan. fridge freezer and washing machine, included in sale. Double door leading to concrete patio area and raised garden.\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7 x 3.0\nCarpet covering on floor. Built in floor to ceiling wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.2 x 2.7\nCarpet covering on floor. Built in floor to ceiling wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.8 x 2.3\nCarpet covering on floor. Built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - \nComprising w.c, wash hand basin, bath and shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>End terrace property</li><li>Constructed 1999</li><li>Recently redecorated </li><li>convenient location on Convent Rd.</li><li>Within walking distance of all town amenities</li><li>Comprising 3 bedrooms.</li><li>Tarmac driveway with private parking</li><li>Concrete patio and small raised garden area to rear</li><li>Presented well throughout.</li><li>Gas central heating</li><li>Double glazed windows</li><li>Ideal first time buyer property or indeed investment</ul>"
      },
      {
